    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2362120/extras/e69968cfd7094a53c88bc6912f4341da.avif?t=1683134949\" /></span><br><br>Finding Hannah is a relaxing puzzle game about a woman navigating an early midlife crisis.<br><br>Hannah\u2019s got it all: a well-paying job, a fancy coffee machine, and a comfortable life \u2013 so why isn\u2019t she happy? Lead her on a journey of self-discovery as you explore beautiful scenes, find hidden objects, and merge items in this heartfelt family drama.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2362120/extras/2a2ce55caa1caf00e1a5e300da109fa2.avif?t=1683134949\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d A GAME OF OBSERVATION &amp; MEMORY</h2>Search each handcrafted scene to find all the hidden objects. Play at a laid-back pace, finding objects as you go, or master each location to improve your score.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d GENERATIONAL STORY</h2>Hannah is a woman searching for answers. She turns to her grandmother, Eva, and her mother, Sigrid, to find that each of them has her own unique story to tell.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2362120/extras/e88662fbfa9aba1127b22694f40a2ea3.poster.avif?t=1683134949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2362120/extras/e88662fbfa9aba1127b22694f40a2ea3.webm?t=1683134949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2362120/extras/e88662fbfa9aba1127b22694f40a2ea3.mp4?t=1683134949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d CATCHY SOUNDTRACK</h2>Each level features an original, danceable music track that will make you want to move.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d CHARMING &amp; DIVERSE CAST</h2>Get to know a lively cast of characters across three time periods in Berlin.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d PUZZLING GAMEPLAY</h2>Each scene has multiple modes! Can you identify objects only using their silhouettes, or find all of the chess pieces as quickly as you can?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d MERGE &amp; UPGRADE</h2>Earn coffee, self-care goodies, and sweet treats by completing levels, then merge them to get better and better items! Unlock new scenes by fulfilling each order at your own pace.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2362120/extras/abd9b393fd35706386505d27fa340da3.avif?t=1683134949\" /></span>",
